{"id":"41a02c2c6727cb8f16888892c2b145a093086091","axis":"silent","repo":"grafana/loki","sha":"41a02c2c6727cb8f16888892c2b145a093086091","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"pkg/dataobj/README.md","lines":["@@ -382,7 +382,7 @@ The builder (the `dataobj-builder` target) reads log data from Kafka and builds"," "," **Key Features:**"," - Reads from Kafka partitions","-- Accumulates logs into data objects","+- Accumulates logs into data objects, one per tenant and 12-hour window"," - Flushes based on size or idle timeout"," - Commits offsets after successful upload"," - Builds an index object for each uploaded data object and records it in the Table of Contents.","@@ -394,7 +394,7 @@ The builder (the `dataobj-builder` target) reads log data from Kafka and builds"," Manages an index of data objects and their contents for efficient querying."," "," The metastore serves queries by the following:","-1. Fetch and scan relevant Table of Contents (toc) files from the query time range to resolve index objects.","+1. Fetch and scan the querying tenant's Table of Contents (toc) files for every 12-hour window in the query time range to resolve index objects. Each toc file holds a single tenant and is stored at `tocs/<window>/<tenant>/toc.toc`."," 2. Fetches resolved index objects and utilises the contained indexes (stream sections, blooms, etc.) to resolve log objects & metadata such as size and number of log lines."," "," ### Index"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pkg/dataobj/builder/flush_committer.go","lines":["@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ import ("," "," \t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj/index\"","-\t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj/metastore/multitenancy\"","+\t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj/metastore\""," )"," "," // A committer allows mocking of certain [kgo.Client] methods in tests.","@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@ type indexer interface {"," "," // A tocWriter allows mocking of [metastore.TableOfContentsWri